  cookingInstructions:
  - Slice the onion.
  - Slice the garlic.
  - Slice the tomato.
  - Turn the stove to high heat.
  - Put the wok on the stove.
  - Add 1 tbsp of cooking oil.
  - Add the butter.
  - Add the chicken legs.
  - Mix using the spatula.
  - Transfer the seared chicken onto a plate.
  - Add the onions to the wok.
  - Add the garlic.
  - 'Add the bay leaf '
  - 'Add the chop tomato '
  - Put the lid on the wok to simmer.
  - Add 1/4 cup of soy sauce.
  - Add 1/8 tsp of sugar.
  - Mix well using the spatula.
  - Return the chicken to the wok.
  - Put the lid on the wok to simmer.
  - Add 1/2 tsp of annatto (achuete) oil.
  - Add 1/8 tsp of salt.
  - Mix using the spatula.
